In addition, because of the various risks and uncertainties associated with developing and commercializing our solutions, we are unable to predict the extent of future costs that may impact our future profitability. We expect to continue to incur significant expenses for the foreseeable future, and may incur operating losses in the short term if and as we, among other things:

•attract, hire, and retain qualified personnel;

•continue our R&D activities and scale our R&D infrastructure;

